{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C", "description": "This source file implements a management layer for NAND flash memory\u2014specifically, a block mapping and information table system for NAND chips. It includes functions for attaching to NAND devices, managing bad blocks, reading/writing pages, creating and loading info tables, and handling signatures. It also contains mechanisms for rescuing and updating info tables, mapping bad blocks, and integrating with a specific hardware device through provided operations. The code appears to be part of a NAND Flash Translation Layer or Bad Block Management system tailored for MediaTek hardware in the OpenWRT project.", "external_files": ["<linux/crc32.h>", "<linux/slab.h>", "mtk_bmt.h"], "external_methods": ["crc32_le", "printk", "mtd_oobavail", "bmtd._read_oob", "bmtd._write_oob", "bmtd._erase", "bmtd._block_isbad", "bmtd._block_markbad"], "published": ["mtk_bmt_nmbm_ops"], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "u32 nmbm_crc32(u32 crcval,const void * buf,size_t size)", "description": "Calculates CRC32 checksum over a buffer, with support for multi-byte processing.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void nlog_table_creation(struct nmbm_instance * ni,bool main_table,uint32_t start_ba,uint32_t end_ba)", "description": "Logs creation events of info tables.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void nlog_table_update(struct nmbm_instance * ni,bool main_table,uint32_t start_ba,uint32_t end_ba)", "description": "Logs updates to existing info tables.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void nlog_table_found(struct nmbm_instance * ni,bool first_table,uint32_t write_count,uint32_t start_ba,uint32_t end_ba)", "description": "Logs when an info table is found during scanning.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "uint64_t ba2addr(struct nmbm_instance * ni,uint32_t ba)", "description": "Converts block address to linear address based on block shift.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "size2blk", "descri